save(fig,'x.foo'): Plots can not be saved as .foo files (the extension gives the format of the plots: .pdf, .png, .svg, .txt)
save(fig,'x'): The file name x has no extension (the extension gives the format of the plots: .pdf, .png, .svg, .txt)
save(fig,'x.pdf',terminal_width=60): terminal_width can only be used for plots in the terminal or in .txt files
show(fig,terminal='yes'): terminal must be True, False, or "ascii" (not 'yes')
show(fig,terminal_width=60): terminal_width can only be used with terminal=True
show(fig,terminal_color='always'): terminal_color can only be used with terminal=True
show(fig,terminal=True,terminal_color='sometimes'): The colour setting must be auto, always, or never (not "sometimes")
